Replace the plan for meaningful multi-step work. Skip this for simple requests. Give the plan and every todo a short user-facing title. Put longer private working notes in details. Publish the full list before substantive work, allow at most one in-progress step, and replace the full list as work progresses. Preserve IDs for todos that remain, update titles and statuses in place, never reuse an ID for a different todo, and remove todos that no longer apply. Complete every remaining todo before the final response; use an empty list when no plan remains.
